<title>LITHUANIA: CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 22/23.</title>
<headline>CURRENCY FIXINGS FOR APRIL 22/23.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Lithuania set the</p>
<p>following currency fixings for Wednesday, April 23 on Tuesday</p>
<p>The litas is pegged to the U.S. dollar at a rate of four to</p>
<p>one.</p>
<p>		   23.04.97	  22.04.97</p>
<p>    USD	  4.0000	    4.0000</p>
<p>    GBP	  6.5420	    6.5324</p>
<p>    DEM	  2.3427	    2.3505</p>
<p>    ECU	  4.5648	    4.5812</p>
<p>    100JPY     3.1703	    3.1930</p>
<p>    SEK	  0.5227	    0.5242</p>
<p>    FIM	  0.7753	    0.7785</p>
<p>    EKK	  0.2928	    0.2938</p>
<p>    LAT	  6.8758	    6.8948</p>
<p>    1000RUR    0.6963	    0.6963</p>
<p>    PLN	  1.2763	    1.2794</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 22 35 17</p>
